                                <g clip-path="url(#clip0_55_96)">
                                    <path
                                        d="M9 3V8.02344C10.208 8.93644 11 10.37 11 12C11 13.112 10.6447 14.1194 10.0527 14.9414C11.8587 15.8954 13 17.4958 13 19.3848V21H23V3H9ZM13 7H15V9H13V7ZM17 7H19V9H17V7ZM6 9C5.20435 9 4.44129 9.31607 3.87868 9.87868C3.31607 10.4413 3 11.2044 3 12C3 12.7956 3.31607 13.5587 3.87868 14.1213C4.44129 14.6839 5.20435 15 6 15C6.79565 15 7.55871 14.6839 8.12132 14.1213C8.68393 13.5587 9 12.7956 9 12C9 11.2044 8.68393 10.4413 8.12132 9.87868C7.55871 9.31607 6.79565 9 6 9ZM13 11H15V13H13V11ZM17 11H19V13H17V11ZM13 15H15V17H13V15ZM17 15H19V17H17V15ZM6 16C3.149 16 1 17.4558 1 19.3848V21H11V19.3848C11 17.4558 8.851 16 6 16Z"
